
  alphaCertified v1.3.0 (October 16, 2013)
  Jonathan D. Hauenstein and Frank Sottile
         GMP v6.3.0 & MPFR v4.2.2


Please note that all coefficients must be complex rational numbers.

alphaCertified is using the polynomial certification algorithms.

Performing 2 Newton iterations on each of the 38 points using exact arithmetic.


------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The following files have been created:

constantValues:       A list of the values of alpha, beta, and gamma for the points.
refinedPoints:        A list of points after the requested Newton iterations.
summary:              A human-readable summary for each point - main output file.
